CM_ BO_ 39 "EyeSight's ACC request to the hybrid system. All data bytes are zero unless ACC is engaged";
CM_ SG_ 39 Cruise_Activated "Matches ES_Brake.Cruise_Activated. Stays set during driver gas override and ACC standstill hold";
CM_ SG_ 550 Brake "Driver brake pedal only, stays zero while ACC is braking";
CM_ SG_ 360 Brake "Driver brake pedal switch, 0 or 3. Set before Brake_Hybrid.Brake, stays zero while ACC is braking. The stock ACC disengages right after it is set";
CM_ SG_ 360 Throttle_Pedal "Driver accelerator pedal. Throttle.Throttle_Pedal on the main bus is always zero on hybrids";
VAL_ 295 Gear 0 "P" 1 "R" 2 "N" 3 "D" 4 "B";
